## Contributors

(No external contributors yet — RectaBot v1.0 is a solo founder project
with AI assistance. This file will grow as the community contributes.)


---

## How to be added

If you contribute code, documentation, hardware modifications, translations,
or other meaningful improvements via pull request, you will be listed here
in your preferred form (name, GitHub handle, email — your choice).

By contributing, you agree to license your contribution under the same
terms as the relevant part of the project (MIT for code/docs, CERN-OHL-S
for hardware, GPL-3.0 for firmware fork).
